Hi,

I am trying to merge two directories: sound/soc/at32 and sound/soc/at91,
to have a single atmel interface.
I have written a patch but I can't test it on avr32 boards, nor eti 
board, so if any body can test it, it would be appreciated.

I have changed the file eti_b1_wm8731.c, because the ssc was allocated
in it and it should be allocated in the board file. So there are some
changes to do in the eti board file otherwise the dai will not work for
the eti board.

I didn't change the i2c initialization since I don't know what is the 
status of the patch(I tried this one: 
http://git.kernel.org/?p=linux/kernel/git/tiwai/sound-2.6.git;a=commitdiff;h=be99827ea333eb15560a8b52ba57a2dce1bdfbb8
but I not sure it is complete??

Regards,
Sedji


